Goal: Deterministic, low‑latency mapping from raw data to internal encrypted state.

4.2 Cryptographic Kernel (TSEC)

AES‑GALDIS Pipeline:

High‑throughput symmetric encryption integrated into the compute path.

Key Hierarchy:

Multi‑level keys (K₀, K₁, K₂…) tied to system state and privilege.

NTT State Transform:

Ciphertext reshaped into algebraically convenient forms for physics updates.

